From: Joshua Klinesmith
Subject: [PATCH wireless] wifi: mt76: mt7915: fix WED WCID for MT7986/MT7981 wmac

MT7986/MT7981 need the real station WCID in the WED forward path, otherwise
WED TX offload is non-functional. Not yet merged upstream; rebased onto v7.3.

Link: https://ratatoskr.run/linux-wireless/2026/04/15794044
Fixes: f68d67623dec ("mt76: mt7915: add Wireless Ethernet Dispatch support")
---
diff --git a/drivers/net/wireless/mediatek/mt76/mt7915/main.c b/drivers/net/wireless/mediatek/mt76/mt7915/main.c
index a8286f8..a966bb0 100644
--- a/drivers/net/wireless/mediatek/mt76/mt7915/main.c
+++ b/drivers/net/wireless/mediatek/mt76/mt7915/main.c
@@ -1753,7 +1753,8 @@ mt7915_net_fill_forward_path(struct ieee80211_hw *hw,
 	path->dev = ctx->dev;
 	path->mtk_wdma.wdma_idx = wed->wdma_idx;
 	path->mtk_wdma.bss = mvif->mt76.idx;
-	path->mtk_wdma.wcid = is_mt7915(&dev->mt76) ? msta->wcid.idx : 0x3ff;
+	path->mtk_wdma.wcid = (is_mt7915(&dev->mt76) || is_mt798x(&dev->mt76)) ?
+			      msta->wcid.idx : 0x3ff;
 	path->mtk_wdma.queue = phy->mt76->band_idx;
 
 	ctx->dev = NULL;
